      "review": {
        "reference": "https://biblehub.com/interlinear/philippians/3-21.htm",
        "note": "The CrossWire OSIS annotation at commit d490be7e34762deb2c76cb2c1306d4808e27890d reverses the two pronouns: English it is tagged src17 lemma.TR:αυτου, while English his is tagged src11 lemma.TR:αυτο. This explicit review instead links actual N1904 αὐτοῦ (token12, modifying glory) to English his. TR-only that it may be remains explicit. τῆς δόξης is the genitive phrase rendered adjectivally glorious; τοῦ δύνασθαι αὐτόν is the short nominalized ability clause rendered whereby he is able."
